### ============================================================================
### EMAIL VERIFICATION TESTING
### ============================================================================
### File ini berisi contoh request untuk testing fitur Email Verification
### Gunakan REST Client extension di VS Code untuk menjalankan request ini
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@contentType = application/json

### ============================================================================
### 1. REGISTER USER BARU
### ============================================================================
### User akan dibuat dengan emailVerified = false
### Email verification akan dikirim otomatis

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Test User Email Verification",
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123",
  "image": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### Expected Response:
### {
###   "id": 123,
###   "name": "Test User Email Verification",
###   "email": "test-email-verify@example.com",
###   "image": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg",
###   "message": "Registration successful. Please check your email to verify your account."
### }

### ============================================================================
### 2. TEST LOGIN SEBELUM EMAIL VERIFIED
### ============================================================================
### Ini akan GAGAL karena email belum diverifikasi

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Expected Error Response (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Please verify your email before logging in. Check your inbox for the verification link."
### }

### ============================================================================
### 3. VERIFY EMAIL
### ============================================================================
### Copy token dari email yang diterima dan replace TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL
### Token expired setelah 1 jam

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email?token=TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL

### Example:
### GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email?token=a1b2c3d4e5f6...

### Expected Success Response:
### {
###   "message": "Email verified successfully",
###   "user": {
###     "id": 123,
###     "name": "Test User Email Verification",
###     "email": "test-email-verify@example.com"
###   }
### }

### Expected Error Response - Invalid Token (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Invalid or expired verification token"
### }

### Expected Error Response - Token Expired (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Verification token has expired"
### }

### ============================================================================
### 4. TEST LOGIN SETELAH EMAIL VERIFIED
### ============================================================================
### Setelah email diverifikasi, login akan BERHASIL

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com",
  "password": "TestPassword123"
}

### Expected Success Response:
### {
###   "user": {
###     "id": 123,
###     "name": "Test User Email Verification",
###     "email": "test-email-verify@example.com",
###     ...
###   },
###   "accessToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "refreshToken": "eyJhbGc...",
###   "sessionId": "ckm1x...",
###   "message": "Login successful"
### }

### ============================================================================
### 5. RESEND VERIFICATION EMAIL
### ============================================================================
### Jika user tidak menerima email atau token sudah expired,
### gunakan endpoint ini untuk mengirim ulang

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com"
}

### Expected Success Response:
### {
###   "message": "Verification email sent. Please check your inbox."
### }

### Expected Error - User Not Found (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "User not found"
### }

### Expected Error - Already Verified (409):
### {
###   "statusCode": 409,
###   "message": "Email already verified"
### }

### ============================================================================
### 6. TEST MULTIPLE RESEND (untuk testing rate limiting - jika diimplementasi)
### ============================================================================

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com"
}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com"
}

###

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test-email-verify@example.com"
}

### ============================================================================
### EDGE CASES & ERROR SCENARIOS
### ============================================================================

### 7. Test Verify dengan Token Kosong

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email?token=

### Expected Error (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Verification token is required"
### }

### ============================================================================

### 8. Test Verify dengan Token Invalid

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email?token=invalid-token-123

### Expected Error (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Invalid or expired verification token"
### }

### ============================================================================

### 9. Test Resend tanpa Email

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
}

### Expected Error (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "Email is required"
### }

### ============================================================================

### 10. Test Resend dengan Email yang Tidak Terdaftar

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com"
}

### Expected Error (401):
### {
###   "statusCode": 401,
###   "message": "User not found"
### }

### ============================================================================
### TESTING WORKFLOW (Complete Flow)
### ============================================================================
### 
### 1. Register user baru (request #1)
### 2. Check email inbox untuk verification link
### 3. Copy token dari email
### 4. Test login sebelum verify (request #2) - harus gagal
### 5. Verify email dengan token (request #3)
### 6. Test login setelah verify (request #4) - harus berhasil
### 7. (Optional) Test resend untuk user yang sudah verified (request #5) - harus error
###
### ============================================================================

